WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:00,777
Oh no!

2
00:00:01,577 --> 00:00:04,424
A muddy blob wants to peek at Maya's private papers!

3
00:00:05,224 --> 00:00:07,781
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

4
00:00:08,581 --> 00:00:09,978
This is Episode 51.

5
00:00:10,778 --> 00:00:12,635
Maya has a big pile of papers.

6
00:00:13,435 --> 00:00:14,292
Too many to check.

7
00:00:15,092 --> 00:00:16,369
Here comes the secret lamp.

8
00:00:17,169 --> 00:00:18,416
It floats over the pile.

9
00:00:19,216 --> 00:00:22,263
Blank, blank, then it stops on a paper with a heart.

10
00:00:23,063 --> 00:00:24,160
The lamp turns pink.

11
00:00:24,960 --> 00:00:25,957
That one is private.

12
00:00:26,757 --> 00:00:28,634
It keeps going and finds another heart.

13
00:00:29,434 --> 00:00:30,661
Two private papers!

14
00:00:31,461 --> 00:00:33,568
Maya puts both hearts in the whisper jar.

15
00:00:34,368 --> 00:00:35,525
The lid closes tight.

16
00:00:36,325 --> 00:00:38,332
The blob rolls up and looks at the pile.

17
00:00:39,132 --> 00:00:40,339
Only blank papers.

18
00:00:41,139 --> 00:00:41,926
It rolls away.

19
00:00:42,726 --> 00:00:45,303
Find the private papers before anyone else does.

20
00:00:46,103 --> 00:00:47,710
Now you know Amazon Macie!

21
00:00:48,510 --> 00:00:50,387
Check out the Cloud Town book series.

22
00:00:51,187 --> 00:00:52,084
Link in the bio.

23
00:00:52,884 --> 00:00:53,841
See you next time!

